{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dweller is a slow-burning first-person psychological-survival horror experience set in the decaying sewer systems beneath an abandoned city. Discover the horrors that lurk in the sewers through radio conversations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the newest recruit of the City Maintenance Division, sent into the sealed tunnels. Armed only with a dim headlamp and a radio, you enter alone. There are no maps, no backup, and no clear answers. The tools you need lie somewhere in the darkness, if you can find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate rusted corridors and flooded chambers, it becomes clear these tunnels hold more than abandoned infrastructure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice crackles through your radio, watching and guiding you while hiding true intentions. They know your name and your location, but they are not here to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now there's no way back. Only down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/33147d647e3a12b9e33c3e46c30b77e7.avif?t=1755469231\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Claustrophobic Descent into Darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re deep in the tunnels under the city. The air\u2019s heavy, the walls feel too close, and the only voice you\u2019ve got is a crackling radio telling stories you\u2019re not sure are true.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Told Through the Static</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The voice on the other end knows things about the city, about you. Every broadcast peels back another layer, but the more you hear, the less it all makes sense.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Ending</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different paths, three different fates. Choose yours...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Psychological Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares, just relentless dread and deadly encounters. The deeper you go, the more your senses fail, your gear falters, your mind fractures\u2026 and terrifying enemies close in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.poster.avif?t=1755469231\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.webm?t=1755469231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.mp4?t=1755469231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2871090?t=1755469231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/b7038ab609b9a21e3e4986ac8455741b95d8a02d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755469231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/f93c6ed913b412b1926e44bc10d8ec38585db741/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755469231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/f93c6ed913b412b1926e44bc10d8ec38585db741/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755469231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains mild violence, blood, and horror themes. It includes disturbing imagery, psychological horror, gore, and intense scenes that may be unsettling to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dweller is a slow-burning first-person psychological-survival horror experience set in the decaying sewer systems beneath an abandoned city. Discover the horrors that lurk in the sewers through radio conversations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the newest recruit of the City Maintenance Division, sent into the sealed tunnels. Armed only with a dim headlamp and a radio, you enter alone. There are no maps, no backup, and no clear answers. The tools you need lie somewhere in the darkness, if you can find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate rusted corridors and flooded chambers, it becomes clear these tunnels hold more than abandoned infrastructure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice crackles through your radio, watching and guiding you while hiding true intentions. They know your name and your location, but they are not here to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now there's no way back. Only down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/33147d647e3a12b9e33c3e46c30b77e7.avif?t=1755469231\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Claustrophobic Descent into Darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re deep in the tunnels under the city. The air\u2019s heavy, the walls feel too close, and the only voice you\u2019ve got is a crackling radio telling stories you\u2019re not sure are true.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Told Through the Static</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The voice on the other end knows things about the city, about you. Every broadcast peels back another layer, but the more you hear, the less it all makes sense.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Ending</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different paths, three different fates. Choose yours...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Psychological Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares, just relentless dread and deadly encounters. The deeper you go, the more your senses fail, your gear falters, your mind fractures\u2026 and terrifying enemies close in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.poster.avif?t=1755469231\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.webm?t=1755469231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.mp4?t=1755469231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Alex Le Mesurier"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/b5380ceed7dfbfbf31f1c2a357c6deab7179a834/header.jpg?t=1755469231","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":